  "hindi": "तुझ सहयोगी के साथ, तेरी उस मित्रता में, हे सोम, इन्द्र ने मनु के लिए जलों को प्रवाहित किया। उसने अहि को मारा, सात नदियों को छोड़ा, बन्द-से छिद्रों को खोल दिया।",
  "english": "With you as yoke-mate, then, in your friendship, O Soma, Indra made the waters flow for Manu. He slew the serpent, released the seven rivers, uncovered the openings, as if shut.",
  "text_flags": [],
  "notes": "tvā yujā: tvā is read as an instrumental (tvayā). tat is read adverbially ('then'); it could also refer to the following deed. sasrutaḥ kaḥ is read 'made flowing'. ahi is rendered 'the serpent'; no name or identification is added.",
  "confidence": "medium"
 },
